Exactly the way I play Minecraft is the way I go through these things in real life.

71
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:19,140
I'm basically redstoning in my bathroom, you know?

72
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,760
I'm terrible at it.

73
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:22,560
It's horrible.

74
