She loves it now.

164
00:21:08,150 --> 00:21:09,970
I'm so happy that she's enjoying it.

165
00:21:11,170 --> 00:21:13,830
At first, I was so afraid that she was gonna hate it so much, you know?

166
00:21:13,950 --> 00:21:14,790
But no, she loves it.

167
00:21:16,030 --> 00:21:19,150
