We just reduced that by two minutes.

197
00:22:29,130 --> 00:22:30,110
So it's like three minutes from now.

198
00:22:36,410 --> 00:22:38,050
I'm gonna play Minecraft very soon, guys.

199
00:22:38,130 --> 00:22:39,130
Within five minutes, don't worry.

200
00:22:41,430 --> 00:22:42,530
I'm procrastinating gaming.

201
00:22:42,870 --> 00:22:43,810
