I don't know what that means.

206
00:22:57,030 --> 00:22:58,450
I don't have a bedrock pattern.

207
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:05,320
I'm not sure it's just ADHD.

208
00:23:05,760 --> 00:23:07,520
It's just a normal thing for humans, I guess.

209
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,820
Valheim 1.0 on September 9th.

210
