Which Dark Souls did you like the best?

218
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:36,440
Dark Souls won, baby!

219
00:23:40,170 --> 00:23:41,010
It's so good.

220
00:23:42,370 --> 00:23:44,090
Are you doing Season 4 of Minecraft?

221
