231
00:24:14,240 --> 00:24:14,920
On Tuesday.

232
00:24:15,760 --> 00:24:17,280
She will wear a wig on Tuesday.

233
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:19,080
Hehehehe.

234
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,240
Big shout out from Brazil.

235
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:21,520
Yo, what's up, Rafael?

236
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,700
How you doing over there?

237
00:24:26,260 --> 00:24:28,600
They speak Portuguese over there in Brazil, you know that?

238
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,580
I don't know why, that blows my mind, man.

239
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:33,300
Ever since Lemmy told me about it, I can't stop thinking about it.

240
00:24:36,190 --> 00:24:38,190
Why don't they speak Brazilian in Brazil?

241
00:24:38,550 --> 00:24:39,770
What, what the hell?

242
00:24:40,970 --> 00:24:42,270
Why do they speak Portuguese?

243
00:24:42,410 --> 00:24:44,750
It's like saying they speak Norwegian in Denmark.

244
00:24:46,230 --> 00:24:46,750
Why?

245
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:49,510
They don't, they do!

246
00:24:51,370 --> 00:24:53,070
They speak Braille in Brazil?

247
00:24:53,230 --> 00:24:53,450
No.

248
00:24:55,010 --> 00:24:56,070
I don't think so.

249
00:24:57,030 --> 00:24:58,290
Maybe, I guess some people do.

250
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:00,790
Because colonization?

251
00:25:00,790 --> 00:25:01,270
Oh, okay.

252
00:25:02,070 --> 00:25:02,950
Say no more, fam.

253
00:25:08,210 --> 00:25:09,190
We don't speak Dutch.

254
00:25:09,370 --> 00:25:11,210
That's, that's a, that's a lie.

255
00:25:13,150 --> 00:25:14,590
How bad is the echo, by the way?

256
00:25:15,670 --> 00:25:16,970
Now that you've heard me for a bit.

257
00:25:18,390 --> 00:25:20,930
Is it very, uh, very obvious?

258
00:25:23,350 --> 00:25:24,730
But you can hear the difference, right?

259
00:25:24,910 --> 00:25:25,530
Compared to normally?

260
00:25:26,190 --> 00:25:27,490
I know it's been a week, but still.

261
00:25:30,860 --> 00:25:31,700
Can't hear it, basically?

262
00:25:31,780 --> 00:25:33,720
That's crazy, because I can hear it through my headphones.

263
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:35,700
Like, bouncing all over.

264
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:38,560
Okay, well...

265
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:41,380
Maybe you guys have a low pain threshold, or something.

266
00:25:42,360 --> 00:25:43,700
I guess I'm just very...

267
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:45,480
sensitive to that stuff.

